1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
You've woken up as Toji Fushiguro.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,020
In real life.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,700
You have zero cursed energy.

4
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,780
Nothing in this world can sense you.

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,160
In the story, that isn't a weakness.

6
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,200
It's the trade he was born with.

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,580
In your version, there's a curse hunting your

8
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,300
best friend tonight.

9
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,820
You're the only thing it can't feel coming.

10
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,200
But first, it's 3:07 in the

11
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,940
morning, and your hands are shaking, because they

12
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,920
are much stronger than they should be.

13
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,480
Toji was born with a Heavenly Restriction.

14
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,020
It took away all of his cursed energy

15
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,420
and gave him a body and senses at

16
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:35,860
the limit.

17
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,920
You sit up and the bed frame cracks.

18
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,820
You reach for the light switch and the

19
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,060
plate comes off in your hand.

20
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,140
Just a plastic plate.

21
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,760
You hold it very, very carefully.

22
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,820
Then the sounds arrive.

23
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,480
The fridge, the pipes behind the wall, a

24
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,660
neighbour's heartbeat three floors down.

25
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,760
In the story, his senses are sharp enough

26
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:01,400
to catch curses by tiny changes in the

27
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,560
air and the temperature.

28
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,840
You step into the corridor and the air

29
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,160
is colder by the stairs.

30
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,300
A small, quiet,

31
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,160
wrong kind of cold.

32
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,320
In your version, that's the curse's trail.

33
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:15,400
Faint.

34
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:16,360
Old.

35
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,180
Moving toward Dani's building.

36
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:20,320
Dani is your best friend.

37
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,960
Dani is also the only person you know

38
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,140
who can see curses.

39
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,040
You take the stairs.

40
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:29,840
All eleven floors, in under a minute, without

41
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,640
being out of breath.

42
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,340
You didn't mean to run.

43
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:33,960
Your legs just decided.

44
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,400
On the way down you pass a mirror.

45
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,400
You stop.

46
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:38,980
It's your face.

47
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:42,220
Same tired eyes, same crooked nose.

48
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,640
But the way you stand has changed.

49
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,120
Quieter.

50
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:46,880
Lighter.

51
00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:49,720
Like someone who has already decided where the

52
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,320
exits are.

53
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:52,920
In your version, you keep your own face.

54
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,520
The body is his,

55
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,820
and you're just the one living in it.

56
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,140
You grab your jacket.

57
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,720
It's a size too small.

58
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,120
You keep it anyway.

59
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:04,860
Dani opens the door at 3:40 with

60
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:06,120
a mug, half asleep.

61
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,220
"I can't feel you," she says, frowning.

62
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,240
"Say something."

63
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:13,660
"I'm right here." "I know you're there.

64
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:14,900
I can hear you.

65
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,580
But I can't feel you.

66
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:18,040
It's like you're a...

67
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:21,060
hole." She has a scanner her mother built.

68
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:23,880
A little box that reads cursed energy and

69
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,560
shows a number.

70
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,320
It reads the neighbour's cat.

71
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,040
It reads Dani.

72
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,020
It reads the fridge, a little, because the

73
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:30,540
fridge is old.

74
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:32,740
You stand next to it and the screen

75
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:36,740
says: CE LEVEL, 0.00 percent.

76
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:37,360
STATUS,

77
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:38,200
none.

78
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:41,200
In the story, Toji was called the invisible

79
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:41,580
man.

80
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,000
Nothing could sense him, unless it came from

81
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,940
the energy in his tools or a curse

82
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,480
he carried.

83
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,520
In your version, that's the whole trick.

84
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,460
And the whole cost.

85
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,560
Dani looks at the number for a long

86
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:53,960
time.

87
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,080
"Nobody's ever going to be able to find

88
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:56,900
you," she says.

89
00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:59,580
"Even if they want to." You say you

90
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:00,400
don't need to be found.

91
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:01,680
She doesn't answer.

92
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:04,860
In the story, his clan, the Zenin, pushed

93
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:07,040
him out for relying on tools instead of

94
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,400
energy.

95
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:08,420
You think:

96
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,380
yes, that sounds right.

97
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,940
You walk Dani home through the empty street.

98
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:17,140
She walks half a step behind, scanning every

99
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:17,540
doorway.

100
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,900
The street is full of tiny curses.

101
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,890
Little grey knots that drift between the lamp

102
00:03:22,890 --> 00:03:25,200
posts, feeding on the loud, tired people who

103
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:25,720
walk by.

104
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:28,080
They follow Dani like moths.

105
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,740
Not one of them turns toward you.

106
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,480
One brushes your shoulder.

107
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:33,840
It doesn't stop.

108
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,360
It doesn't hesitate.

109
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,320
It simply drifts on, as if you were

110
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,120
a piece of the wall.

111
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:42,040
In your version, that's how the world sees

112
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:42,460
you now.

113
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:44,120
Not as an enemy.

114
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,740
As nothing at all.

115
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,700
You'd expected to feel powerful.

116
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,980
You feel, mostly, a little lonely.

117
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:54,240
Dani sees your face and says, gently: "It's

118
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,100
not a bad thing.

119
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,360
It's just a very quiet thing."

120
00:03:58,020 --> 00:03:59,420
At the end of the street, she stops

121
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:01,060
and looks at the shrine on the hill,

122
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:02,860
black against a red sky.

123
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,080
"It's been there for a month," she says.

124
00:04:05,820 --> 00:04:08,020
"It eats the loudest person in range.

125
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:09,220
That's me.

126
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,200
Tonight,

127
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:14,380
that's me." Dani's mother left something in the

128
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:15,840
storage unit under the shrine.

129
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:18,140
A long black case.

130
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:19,240
Four tools.

131
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,620
You know what they are before you open

132
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:21,940
it.

133
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,840
The Inverted Spear of Heaven nullifies a technique

134
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,380
the moment it touches it.

135
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:30,420
In the story, it ended Gojo's Infinity.

136
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,860
In your version, it only cancels what is

137
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:35,280
active when it touches.

138
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,840
It does nothing to a fist.

139
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:38,540
It does nothing to a wall.

140
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:42,300
The Chain of a Thousand Miles gives it

141
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:44,820
reach, like a kusarigama.

142
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:46,480
You swing it once, in an empty room.

143
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,600
It takes the ceiling light with it.

144
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:51,900
The Split Soul Katana cuts the soul and

145
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:53,260
ignores the body's armor.

146
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:55,860
In your version, it can hurt a curse

147
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:57,340
without cutting a single brick.

148
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:59,220
You test it on a mattress.

149
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:00,960
The mattress is fine.

150
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:02,560
You are not.

151
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:05,560
And the Playful Cloud is a special grade

152
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:05,920
tool.

153
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:07,040
A heavy weapon.

154
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,500
You pick it up one-handed.

155
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:10,720
You're careful with this one too.

156
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,420
Dani watches you.

157
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:14,040
"Please tell me you're not going to do

158
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:14,440
the thing."

159
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:15,680
"What thing?"

160
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:17,840
"The thing where you go and hunt it."

161
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,180
You tell her the truth.

162
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,860
It can't feel you.

163
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:22,020
It can feel her.

164
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:24,160
If she stays home, it comes to her.

165
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,360
If she goes with you, she's bait.

166
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,000
"So I'm bait either way," she says.

167
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:30,640
"Not if I get there first."

168
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:33,440
It's the least reassuring thing you've ever said.

169
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:35,620
She picks up the scanner anyway.

170
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,300
The curse is in the old shrine at

171
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:41,060
the end of the line, where the metro

172
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:41,820
turns around.

173
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:44,680
You can feel it, because your body feels

174
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,160
everything.

175
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,420
A pulse in the cold, like a slow

176
00:05:48,420 --> 00:05:49,460
knock on glass.

177
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:52,260
Dani stays at the gate with the scanner.

178
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:54,820
Her screen shows a big red number for

179
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:55,240
the curse.

180
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:58,580
And for you, just a quiet grey frame

181
00:05:58,580 --> 00:06:00,300
that says NO DETECTION.

182
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:03,340
In your version, that's the rule that makes

183
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:04,040
you dangerous.

184
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,180
Not strength.

185
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:07,620
The fact that it never knows you're coming.

186
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:10,040
You walk up the stairs in silence.

187
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,620
Not a single sound.

188
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,960
The curse is waiting at the top.

189
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:17,280
It's turned toward the gate, toward Dani, toward

190
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,260
all that warm, loud energy.

191
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,980
It isn't looking at you.

192
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:22,300
You're not there.

193
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:25,260
Our guess is that a creature that hunts

194
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:28,320
by sensing energy would never be built to

195
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:30,040
expect something without any.

196
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:32,840
You step into its blind spot, and for

197
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:35,780
one second you are the quietest thing in

198
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:36,180
the world.

199
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,440
It has a technique.

200
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,540
It seals the space around the gate, and

201
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,480
Dani can't leave.

202
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,240
You didn't plan for that.

203
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:45,960
You swing the chain.

204
00:06:46,420 --> 00:06:47,780
It wraps the ward's anchor.

205
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:50,640
You pull the spear down onto the symbol,

206
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:53,400
and the ward goes out like a lightbulb.

207
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,020
The curse turns.

208
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:56,200
It finally feels something.

209
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,320
A shape.

210
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,640
Not an energy.

211
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:00,940
Just a man who weighs too much.

212
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:03,980
Its first strike misses by an inch, because

213
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:06,040
it's aiming at where a person's energy would

214
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,380
be, and there isn't any.

215
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,680
Its second misses by less.

216
00:07:10,460 --> 00:07:10,960
It's learning.

217
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,080
Its third doesn't miss.

218
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:14,300
It hits you.

219
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:17,080
In your version, your body is a wall,

220
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:17,960
not a god.

221
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:19,220
It hurts.

222
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,800
Something in your ribs says so out loud.

223
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,540
You hit back with the katana, the one

224
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,700
that ignores armor.

225
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:26,780
Once.

226
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:27,760
Twice.

227
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:30,320
The curse falls apart without a sound.

228
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:31,480
No dust.

229
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:32,620
Nothing broken.

230
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:33,840
Just gone.

231
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,140
The red moon is very quiet.

232
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:38,200
You stand there, breathing,

233
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,400
waiting for the feeling you expected.

234
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:41,540
Victory.

235
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:42,760
Pride.

236
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:43,920
Something.

237
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,960
There's only the cold, and the tiredness,

238
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:49,860
and the sound of Dani's footsteps stopping at

239
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,160
the gate.

240
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:52,160
Then your legs stop listening.

241
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,580
You fall at the foot of the torii,

242
00:07:55,580 --> 00:07:57,480
behind a pillar, and nobody knows.

243
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,780
Dani is calling your name.

244
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:02,500
Her scanner shows the curse is gone, and

245
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:03,740
it shows nothing else.

246
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,140
It shows no one.

247
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:08,240
In the story, that's what made Toji so

248
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,640
frightening.

249
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,180
Nothing could find him.

250
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:13,360
In your version, that's exactly what's about to

251
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:13,800
kill you.

252
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,340
Dani throws the scanner down.

253
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:18,060
She stops trying to feel you.

254
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,220
She starts listening instead.

255
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:23,600
She hears the chain, dragging softly against the

256
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,680
stone, as you breathe.

257
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,720
She hears your breath, which is thin and

258
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,020
fast.

259
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:30,860
She follows it, the way you followed a

260
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,000
heartbeat through a wall.

261
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,740
She climbs the steps two at a time.

262
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:35,780
She trips.

263
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,220
She gets up and keeps going.

264
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:40,420
Our guess is that being found has never

265
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:41,620
really needed energy.

266
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:44,120
It only needs someone who won't stop looking.

267
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,020
She reaches the pillar.

268
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,800
Her hand finds your jacket before her eyes

269
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,360
find you.

270
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:52,540
You wake up on the stairs, with a

271
00:08:52,540 --> 00:08:54,220
jacket over you that isn't yours.

272
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:57,540
"You can't be found," Dani says, "unless someone

273
00:08:57,540 --> 00:09:00,360
really wants to." You laugh, and it hurts,

274
00:09:00,620 --> 00:09:01,240
and you don't care.

275
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,250
The scanner on the step still says

276
00:09:04,250 --> 00:09:05,720
0.00.

277
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,280
It always will.

278
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:07,380
Born to hunt.

279
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:08,640
Never meant to be found.

280
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,020
So I'll ask you: would you keep a

281
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:13,040
body like that, if nobody could ever sense

282
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,600
you again?

